      "extract": "After the work of Vaughan Jones \\cite{J85} and Edward Witten \\cite{W88,W89}, Vladimir Turaev played a key role in the foundation of quantum topology. Together with Nikolai Reshetikhin \\cite{RT91}, they were the first to obtain a mathematically rigorous construction of Witten's invariants of 3-dimensional manifolds. Turaev showed that the relevant algebraic structure underlying their approach was that of a",
